BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 650.39 Td (1. Purpose and scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 631.99 Td (This policy explains what to do when you are ill, what you are paid and how we support your return to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 617.59 Td (work. It applies to employees on a Norwegian employment contract. Employees in other countries follow) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 603.19 Td (the sick leave policy of their own country.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 573.19 Td (2. Reporting sickness) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 554.79 Td (Tell your line manager before 09:00 on your first day of sickness, and register the absence in the HR) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 540.39 Td (portal the same day. Register again in the HR portal on the day you return to work.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 510.39 Td (3. Self-certification \(egenmelding\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 491.99 Td (Rahmqvist Norge AS has an extended self-certification arrangement. You can self-certify for up to eight) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 477.59 Td (\(8\) calendar days at a time, and up to 24 days in total over any 12 months. You can use self-certification) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 463.19 Td (once you have worked for the company for two \(2\) months; before that, a sick note from a doctor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 448.79 Td (\(sykmelding\) is needed from the first day.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 418.79 Td (4. Sick note \(sykmelding\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 400.39 Td (For sickness lasting longer than eight days, or when your self-certification days are used up, you need a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 385.99 Td (sick note from a doctor. Your doctor sends it electronically, so you only need to approve it.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 355.99 Td (5. Sick pay) Tj ET
