BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 74.00 288.39 Td (The company tops up the difference so that you keep your full salary for up to 12 months.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 258.39 Td (6. Caring for a sick child \(omsorgsdager\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 239.99 Td (You have ten \(10\) care days per calendar year for a sick child, or 15 if you have three or more children.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 225.59 Td (Tell your manager before 09:00 and register the care day in the HR portal. Care days are paid as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 211.19 Td (normal salary.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 181.19 Td (7. Health care) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 162.79 Td (The occupational health service \(bedriftshelsetjeneste\) is free for all employees, and the company's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 148.39 Td (health insurance gives access to a specialist within seven \(7\) days.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.50 Tf 0.070 0.200 0.420 rg 58.00 118.39 Td (8. Follow-up during sick leave) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 99.99 Td (Your manager will draw up a follow-up plan \(oppf¯lgingsplan\) with you within four \(4\) weeks of sick) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 85.59 Td (leave, and hold a dialogue meeting within seven \(7\) weeks, as Norwegian law requires.) Tj ET
